 "widget": "<div class=\"tcf-page tcf-scope tcf-p-ctec-experience-in-lieu-15-hour-course\"><div id=\"tcf-ctec-experience-in-lieu-15-hour-course-root\" class=\"tcf-root\">@@SSR@@</div></div>",
 "ssr": "<div data-screen-label=\"CTEC Experience in Lieu: 15 Hour Course\" class=\"tcf-screen\"><div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/photos/04-tax-forms-calculator-closeup.webp\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"/><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#95AB3B\">For experienced preparers</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.05 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;max-width:900px\">CTEC Experience in Lieu: <span style=\"display:block;font-weight:300\">The 15 Hour California Tax Course</span></h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:660px;text-wrap:pretty\">California law lets certain experienced tax preparers skip the 60 hour qualifying course. Instead they complete a 15 hour California tax law course from a CTEC-approved provider and meet every other registration requirement.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><a data-hv=\"4\" href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B\">Find CTEC-approved providers<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"flex:none;margin-left:2px\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a><a data-hv=\"17\" href=\"#qualify\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:transparent;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5)\">Who qualifies</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div><div id=\"qualify\" style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#fff;scroll-margin-top:110px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Eligibility</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.12 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">Who qualifies for <span style=\"font-weight:300\">experience in lieu</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">CTEC policy TP-04 lists six groups. Each applicant also signs, under penalty of perjury, that they prepared at least <strong>100 tax returns for compensation</strong> in the two years before applying.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">01</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Former California CPAs</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Licensed as a California CPA for the last two years but no longer holding CPA status with the California Board of Accountancy.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">02</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Former California attorneys</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Licensed for the most recent two years but no longer an active member of the State Bar of California.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">03</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Former enrolled agents</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Held enrolled agent (EA) status for the most recent two years but no longer hold the designation.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">04</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Employees of a CPA, attorney or EA</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Prepared tax returns within the scope of that employment during the two most recent years.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">05</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Out-of-state CPAs, attorneys and EAs</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Professionals licensed or enrolled in another state who now prepare California returns.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">06</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Relocated out-of-state employees</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Prepared returns under an exempt preparer\u2019s scope in another state during the two most recent years and have moved to California.</p></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#95AB3B\">Compare the courses</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.12 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;color:#fff\">15 hours instead of 60</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);text-wrap:pretty\">Experience in lieu replaces the qualifying education only. Everyone else starts with the 60 hour CTEC course, and every registered preparer renews with 20 hours a year.</p>\n<a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#95AB3B;margin-top:2px\">Compare 60 hour CTEC courses \u2192</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:18px 24px;background:rgba(108,190,69,.18);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)\"><span style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff\">Experience in lieu</span><span style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">15 hours</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">California tax law course</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">15 hrs</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Standard 60 hour CTEC course</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">60 hrs</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Complete the 15 hour course within</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">18 months</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Finish initial registration within</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">3 years</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Annual renewal (20 hour CTEC course)</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">By Oct 31</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"requirements\" style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#F4F6F7;scroll-margin-top:110px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Still required</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.12 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">Everything else you <span style=\"font-weight:300\">must complete</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Experienced preparers are subject to all of CTEC\u2019s other registration requirements.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">01</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Live Scan and background check</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Submit fingerprints and pass the criminal background check. <a href=\"/ctec-live-scan-background-check/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How the CTEC Live Scan works</a>.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">02</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">IRS PTIN</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Obtain a Preparer Tax Identification Number from the IRS and renew it each year.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">03</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">$5,000 surety bond</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Buy a $5,000 tax preparer surety bond and keep it current.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">04</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Register with CTEC and pay the fees</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Complete registration and pay the required fees. Then renew every year by October 31.</p></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#fff\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n<div><div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330;margin-bottom:10px\">Questions</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 34px/1.12 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;\">Common questions</h2></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">Who qualifies for CTEC experience in lieu?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Former California CPAs, attorneys and enrolled agents who held that status for the most recent two years; employees of a CPA, attorney or EA who prepared returns in that job in the two most recent years; out-of-state CPAs, attorneys and EAs; and out-of-state employees of those professionals who have relocated to California.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">Do I still need a Live Scan, PTIN and bond?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Yes. Experience in lieu only replaces the 60 hour qualifying education. You still complete the <a href=\"/ctec-live-scan-background-check/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Live Scan background check</a>, get an IRS PTIN, buy a $5,000 surety bond and register with CTEC.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">How many returns must I have prepared?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">You sign, under penalty of perjury, that you prepared at least 100 tax returns for compensation in the two years before your application.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">How long do I have to finish?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Complete the 15 hour California tax course within 18 months, and finish all initial registration requirements within 3 years of starting your application.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">What happens after I register?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Like every CRTP you renew by October 31 each year: complete the <a href=\"/ctec-20-hour-course/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">20 hour CTEC course</a> (10 hours federal tax law, 3 hours federal updates, 2 hours ethics, 5 hours California tax law), keep your PTIN and bond current and pay the renewal fees.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">I moved to California from another state. Does this apply to me?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">It can. CTEC says preparers who relocated to California after preparing returns in another state for the most recent two years complete a 15 hour qualifying California tax course. Contact CTEC to confirm your eligibility before you apply.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:56px 56px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:18px;color:#0B2E40\">\n<div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 34px/1.15 'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;color:#0B2E40\">Looking for a 15 hour course?</h2><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:22px;color:#0B2E40\">Many CTEC-approved schools offer one. Check the provider directory, then confirm the 15 hour course with the school.</p></div>\n<a data-hv=\"4\" href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;line-height:1.2;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border:1.5px solid #95AB3B;flex:none\">Browse CTEC-approved providers<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"flex:none;margin-left:2px\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:0 56px 48px;background:#fff\"><p style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Rules summarized from the California Tax Education Council. Requirements and fees can change, so confirm with CTEC before you apply: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Experience-in-Lieu.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC Experience in Lieu webinar (PDF)</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https://ctec.org/media-room/how-to-become-a-tax-preparer-in-california/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How to become a tax preparer in California (CTEC)</a>.</p></div></div>",
